OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFeeling cold
OL,6,Fas strong winds and isolated showers
OL,7,Fcontinue for a time this evening.
OL,8,FThese will ease through the night to
OL,9,Fleave some clear spells before cloud
OL,10,Fand rain push in again towards dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FRain to start, heavy and
OL,13,Fpersistent in places before starting
OL,14,Fto die out by late afternoon. Winds
OL,15,Fstrengthening again through the
OL,16,Fmorning with coastal gales possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
